                <mxCell id="cn-aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-86" value="步骤 3b：事实记忆检索&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;检索位置：&lt;br&gt;共享事实记忆 evidence memory&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;mem-0011｜得分 88.0139&lt;br&gt;答案：当地人在 North Sea 捕鱼。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;mem-0012｜得分 89.7714&lt;br&gt;答案：North Sea 中常见鱼类包括 cod、haddock、...、sandeel。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;作用：&lt;br&gt;这些命中辅助确认 this sea → North Sea" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9E7E2;strokeColor=light-dark(#6B766F,#967FD3);strokeWidth=1.4;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontColor=#123d22;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="cn-aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-83" vertex="1">
