                <mxCell id="cn-aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-87" value="步骤 3c：经验记忆检索&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;mem-0010｜得分 98.6334&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;可复用经验：&lt;br&gt;当问题要求回答“某个上下文实体的某个属性”时，先从历史中解析实体，再只回答当前问题要求的属性。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;本题对应：&lt;br&gt;this sea → North Sea&lt;br&gt;当前属性 = 矿产资源&lt;br&gt;保留 = sand、gravel、rolled pieces of amber&lt;br&gt;排除 = 鱼类 / 经济来源等事实&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;内部标签：attribute_lookup_with_context" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBE9EB;strokeColor=light-dark(#6B766F,#967FD3);strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontColor=#332061;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="cn-aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-83" vertex="1">
