                <mxCell id="cn-retrieved-package-step4" value="步骤 4：检索包送入推理智能体&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;一条 Retriever → Reasoner 消息包含：&lt;br&gt;1 条上下文结果：North Sea / Mineral resources&lt;br&gt;2 条事实记忆结果：mem-0011, mem-0012&lt;br&gt;1 条经验规则：mem-0010&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reasoner 用这个包推出：&lt;br&gt;this sea → North Sea；答案 = sand、gravel、rolled pieces of amber。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9EA9A9;strokeColor=#6B766F;strokeWidth=1.4;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontColor=#102a56;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="cn-aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-83" vertex="1">
